    Section(
      title: 'DOMAIN E: INTERPERSONAL AND COMMUNICATION SKILLS',
      content:
          'Before the first supervised exercise session, the patient freezes at the treadmill. Her eyes fill with tears and she says: "I can\'t do this. What if I get another clot? The last time my heart was beating fast, I passed out and almost died. I can\'t go through that again. My daughter needs her mother."',
